NOTICE & CREDITS
================

richdem-rs is a Rust reimplementation of RichDEM (https://github.com/r-barnes/richdem),
originally designed, authored, and published by Richard Barnes (rbarnes@umn.edu).

All credit for the original library architecture, algorithm implementations,
data structures, and test fixtures goes to Richard Barnes and the original
algorithm authors listed below.

Upstream Project
----------------
- RichDEM: Terrain Analysis Software
  Author: Richard Barnes (https://github.com/r-barnes/richdem)
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0-only)
  Maintained Python fork reference: https://github.com/giswqs/richdem2

Geospatial I/O Dependency
-------------------------
- terrio: Pure-Rust geospatial raster, vector and point cloud data I/O
  Repository: https://github.com/opengeos/terrio
  License: MIT / MPL-2.0 / Apache-2.0

